### List Files

```typescript
const files = await client.beta.files.list({
  betas: ["files-api-2025-04-14"],
});
for (const f of files.data) {
  console.log(`${f.id}: ${f.filename} (${f.size_bytes} bytes)`);
}
```

### Delete a File

```typescript
await client.beta.files.delete("file_011CNha8iCJcU1wXNR6q4V8w", {
  betas: ["files-api-2025-04-14"],
});
```

